#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:572
msgid ""
"This site uses a cookie consent banner powered by Kansleri Cookie Consent. "
"When you interact with the banner, a cookie named <code>kncc_consent</code> "
"is stored in your browser for up to 1 year. It records your consent "
"preferences (which cookie categories you accepted or rejected) so the site "
"can remember your choice on future visits. No personal data is stored in "
"this cookie."
msgstr ""
"Dan is-sit juża banner tal-kunsens għall-cookies ipprovdut minn Kansleri "
"Cookie Consent. Meta tinteraġixxi mal-banner, cookie bl-isem "
"<code>kncc_consent</code> jinħażen fil-browser tiegħek sa massimu ta' sena. "
"Dan jirreġistra l-preferenzi tal-kunsens tiegħek (liema kategoriji ta' "
"cookies aċċettajt jew irrifjutajt) biex is-sit ikun jista' jiftakar l-għażla "
"tiegħek fiż-żjarat futuri. Ma tinħażen l-ebda data personali f'dan il-cookie."

#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:573
msgid ""
"The plugin also records anonymous, aggregated consent statistics (how many "
"visitors accepted, rejected, or customized cookies each day) and individual "
"consent log entries for GDPR audit compliance. Consent log entries contain a"
" hashed (non-reversible) visitor identifier, the consent choice, which "
"categories were accepted, and the policy version. No IP addresses, user "
"identifiers, or personal data are stored in plain text. Consent log records "
"are automatically deleted after 13 months."
msgstr ""
"Il-plugin jirreġistra wkoll statistika anonima u aggregata tal-kunsens "
"(kemm-il viżitatur aċċetta, irrifjuta jew ippersonalizza l-cookies kuljum) u "
"rekords individwali fir-reġistru tal-kunsens għall-konformità mal-verifiki "
"tal-GDPR. Ir-rekords tar-reġistru tal-kunsens fihom identifikatur "
"tal-viżitatur f'forma ta' hash (irriversibbli), l-għażla tal-kunsens, liema "
"kategoriji ġew aċċettati u l-verżjoni tal-politika. L-ebda indirizz IP, "
"identifikatur tal-utent jew data personali ma jinħażen bħala test ċar. "
"Ir-rekords tar-reġistru tal-kunsens jitħassru awtomatikament wara 13-il "
"xahar."

