msgstr "Sinkronizzazzjoni mal-WP Consent API"

#: includes/class-admin.php:806
msgid ""
"When the WP Consent API plugin is active, Kansleri automatically syncs your "
"banner choices to wp_consent_functional, wp_consent_statistics, "
"wp_consent_marketing, and wp_consent_preferences. This lets consent-aware "
"plugins such as Google Site Kit read the visitor's choice. Banner labels "
"(Necessary, Analytics) map to these technical cookie names."
msgstr ""
"Meta l-plugin WP Consent API ikun attiv, Kansleri awtomatikament "
"jissinkronizza l-għażliet tal-banner ma' wp_consent_functional, "
"wp_consent_statistics, wp_consent_marketing u wp_consent_preferences. Dan "
"jippermetti lil plugins li jirrispettaw il-kunsens, bħal Google Site Kit, "
"jaqraw l-għażla tal-viżitatur. It-tikketti tal-banner (Neċessarji, "
"Analitika) jikkorrispondu għal dawn l-ismijiet tekniċi tal-cookies."

#: includes/class-admin.php:939
